%%% note
由来: https://docs.mulesoft.com/dataweave/2.11/dw-strings-functions-islowercase (関数ページ)
doc と相違 (doc の Output と実 DW の出力の値が一致しない)
doc の Output:
  {
    "a": false,
    "b": false,
    "c": false,
    "d": false,
    "e": false,
    "f": false,
    "g": false,
    "h": false,
    "i": true,
    "j": false
  }
%%% script
%dw 2.0
import isLowerCase from dw::core::Strings
output application/json
---
{
  "a": isLowerCase(null),
  "b": isLowerCase(""),
  "c": isLowerCase("  "),
  "d": isLowerCase("abc"),
  "e": isLowerCase("aBC"),
  "f": isLowerCase("a c"),
  "g": isLowerCase("a1c"),
  "h": isLowerCase("a/c"),
  "i": isLowerCase("mulesöft"),
  "j": isLowerCase("mulesÖft")
}
%%% output application/json
{
  "a": false,
  "b": false,
  "c": false,
  "d": true,
  "e": false,
  "f": false,
  "g": false,
  "h": false,
  "i": true,
  "j": false
}
